#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:12
msgid "Tutorials"
msgstr "教程"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:14
msgid ""
"This chapter provides detailed hands-on tutorials to help you gain an in-"
"depth understanding of various application scenarios of Kaiwu-PyTorch-"
"Plugin."
msgstr "本章提供详细的实践教程，帮助您深入了解 Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin 的各种应用场景。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:16
msgid ""
"Before you start, make sure you have KPP installed and have gone through the"
" [Quick Start](../quickstart.md). For theoretical background, see "
"[Theoretical Foundations](../../theoretical-foundations/index.md)."
msgstr ""
"开始之前，请确保您已安装 KPP "
"并完成[快速入门](../quickstart.md)。理论背景请参阅[理论基础](../../theoretical-"
"foundations/index.md)。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:18
msgid "Architecture Overview"
msgstr "架构概览"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:20
msgid ""
"New to KPP? Start here to understand how the model families fit together."
msgstr "刚接触 KPP？从这里开始，了解各个模型家族如何组合在一起。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:29
msgid ""
"[KPP Architecture Overview](architecture_overview.md): Design philosophy, "
"model hierarchy, and how RBM, DBN, Q-VAE, and Q-Diffusion build on each "
"other."
msgstr ""
"[KPP 架构概览](architecture_overview.md)：设计理念、模型层级，以及 RBM、DBN、Q-VAE 和 "
"Q-Diffusion 如何相互构建。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:31
msgid "Hands-on Tutorials"
msgstr "实践教程"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:33
msgid ""
"Start from the sampling bottleneck and work through end-to-end applications "
"that introduce one new concept at a time."
msgstr "从采样瓶颈开始，逐步学习端到端应用，每次引入一个新概念。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:35
msgid "Quantum Sampling for Energy-Based Models"
msgstr "基于能量模型的量子采样"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:46
msgid ""
"[Why Quantum? Revisiting the Sampling "
"Bottleneck](quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md): The intractable partition "
"function, slow MCMC mixing, and the quantum alternative."
msgstr ""
"[为何需要量子？重访采样瓶颈](quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md)：难以计算的配分函数、缓慢的 MCMC "
"混合，以及量子替代方案。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:47
msgid ""
"[Simulated Annealing for Ising Models](simulated_annealing.md): Mapping "
"energy functions to Ising Hamiltonians and building a local sampling "
"baseline."
msgstr ""
"[用于 Ising 模型的模拟退火](simulated_annealing.md)：将能量函数映射为 Ising 哈密顿量，并建立本地采样基线。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:48
msgid ""
"[Integrating Quantum Samplers into PyTorch](quantum_sampling_pytorch.md): "
"Swapping the local SA sampler for the CIM sampler within the KPP training "
"loop, with the core interfaces explained."
msgstr ""
"[将量子采样器集成到 PyTorch](quantum_sampling_pytorch.md)：在 KPP 训练循环中将本地 SA 采样器替换为 "
"CIM 采样器，并说明核心接口。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:50
msgid "Tutorial 1: Generative Modeling with a Full Boltzmann Machine"
msgstr "教程 1：全连接玻尔兹曼机生成建模"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:59
msgid ""
"[BM Generation](bm_generation.md): Unsupervised data generation with a fully"
" connected Boltzmann Machine. Example: `example/bm_generation/`."
msgstr ""
"[BM 生成](bm_generation.md)：使用全连接玻尔兹曼机进行无监督数据生成。示例：`example/bm_generation/`。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:61
msgid "Tutorial 2: Feature Learning and Classification with RBMs and DBNs"
msgstr "教程 2：RBM 与 DBN 的特征学习与分类"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:71
msgid ""
"[RBM Classification: Handwritten Digit Recognition](rbm_classification.md): "
"Feature learning and classification with a single RBM. Example: "
"`example/rbm_digits/rbm_digits.ipynb`."
msgstr ""
"[RBM 分类：手写数字识别](rbm_classification.md)：使用单个 RBM "
"进行特征学习与分类。示例：`example/rbm_digits/rbm_digits.ipynb`。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:72
msgid ""
"[DBN Classification: Deep Belief Networks](dbn_classification.md): Stacking "
"RBMs into a Deep Belief Network for hierarchical features. Example: "
"`example/dbn_digits/supervised_dbn_digits.ipynb`."
msgstr ""
"[DBN 分类：深度信念网络](dbn_classification.md)：将 RBM "
"堆叠为深度信念网络以学习层次化特征。示例：`example/dbn_digits/supervised_dbn_digits.ipynb`。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:74
msgid "Tutorial 3: Quantum Variational Autoencoder (Q-VAE)"
msgstr "教程 3：量子变分自编码器（Q-VAE）"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:83
msgid ""
"[Q-VAE: Quantum Variational Autoencoder](qvae_mnist.md): Replacing the "
"Gaussian prior with a quantum RBM for image generation and representation "
"learning. Example: `example/qvae_mnist/run_pipeline.py`."
msgstr ""
"[Q-VAE：量子变分自编码器](qvae_mnist.md)：用量子 RBM "
"替代高斯先验，用于图像生成与表征学习。示例：`example/qvae_mnist/run_pipeline.py`。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:85
msgid "Case Studies"
msgstr "案例研究"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:87
msgid ""
"Case studies build directly on the hands-on tutorials and show how KPP is "
"used on larger-scale public datasets. Each study packages a complete "
"pipeline — data loading, model definition, training, and evaluation — and "
"lives alongside a runnable example under `example/`."
msgstr ""
"案例研究直接基于实践教程，展示 KPP "
"如何应用于更大规模的公开数据集。每个研究都封装了完整的流程——数据加载、模型定义、训练和评估——并附带一个可运行的示例，位于 `example/` 下。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:98
msgid ""
"[Q-VAE for Single-Cell Transcriptomics](qvae_cell.md): single-cell "
"representation learning with a QVAE; UMAP and clustering evaluation (Leiden,"
" classification, scIB, scGraph, DPT). Example: `example/qvae_cell/`."
msgstr ""
"[Q-VAE 用于单细胞转录组学](qvae_cell.md)：使用 QVAE 进行单细胞表示学习；UMAP "
"和聚类评估（Leiden、分类、scIB、scGraph、DPT）。示例：`example/qvae_cell/`。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:99
msgid ""
"[Q-VAE for Energy-Supervised Anomaly Detection](qvae_anomaly.md): "
"CleanEnergyQVAE with a free-energy scoring head and NCE-style contrastive "
"objective on thyroid / creditcard benchmarks. Example: "
"`example/qvae_anomaly/`."
msgstr ""
"[Q-VAE 用于能量监督异常检测](qvae_anomaly.md)：CleanEnergyQVAE 带有自由能量评分头和 NCE 风格对比目标，在 "
"thyroid / creditcard 基准上进行评估。示例：`example/qvae_anomaly/`。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:100
msgid ""
"[Q-Diffusion for Protein Sequence Generation](qdiffusion.md): discrete "
"diffusion with a quantum-accelerated energy reranker and a DPLM backbone. "
"Example: `example/qdiffusion/`."
msgstr ""
"[Q-Diffusion 用于蛋白质序列生成](qdiffusion.md)：离散扩散，带有量子加速能量重排序器和 DPLM "
"骨干网络。示例：`example/qdiffusion/`。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:102
msgid "Coming Soon"
msgstr "即将推出"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:104
msgid "More tutorials and case studies are in progress:"
msgstr "更多教程和案例研究正在准备中："

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:106
msgid ""
"**Feature Selection with Quantum Annealing**: Using CIM for feature "
"selection on tabular datasets, with linear regression and neural network "
"downstream tasks. *Example: `example/feature_selection/`.*"
msgstr ""
"**量子退火特征选择**：使用 CIM "
"对表格数据集进行特征选择，结合线性回归和神经网络下游任务。*示例：`example/feature_selection/`.*"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Downloads/kaiwu_pytorch_plugin_update/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:107
msgid ""
"**Gaussian-Bernoulli RBM**: Extending RBM to continuous-valued inputs. *API:"
" `GaussianBernoulliRestrictedBoltzmannMachine`.*"
msgstr ""
"**高斯-伯努利 RBM**：将 RBM "
"扩展到连续值输入。*API：`GaussianBernoulliRestrictedBoltzmannMachine`。*"

